{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>內地女星蔣欣因在2011年演出經典宮鬥劇《後宮甄嬛傳》中的「華妃」一角紅遍兩岸三地，深受廣大觀眾喜愛。她日前身穿一襲紅色新中式刺繡禮服盛裝出席品牌大秀，沒想到在與男設計師合照時，竟遭對方無預警「突襲親脖子」！蔣欣當場露出驚嚇表情並本能抗拒，畫面曝光後瞬間引發大批網友熱烈議論與撻伐。</p><p>蔣欣26日盛裝亮相MESSENTIAL品牌大秀，在現場曝光的影片中，她正與該品牌的男設計師馬凱準備合照，怎料對方在靠近時，竟然突然凑上前親吻她的脖頸。</p><figure><img alt=\"蔣欣與男設計師合影，突遭「親脖子」嚇壞。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191807714200653824403872.jpeg/mjetjM_MAnyhROSfrs9YxhiVh20cpHG0-JHB5_iRwec\"/><figcaption>蔣欣與男設計師合影，突遭「親脖子」嚇壞。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>更多蔣欣遭男設計師「突襲吻頸」現場畫面：</p><figure><img alt=\"蔣欣遭男設計師突襲吻頸。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191809789504524288205743.jpeg/fGBVlVqeg-IbFAr3bz7hFA4YxL9KfUZOyr0u_sq9Lv4\"/><figcaption>蔣欣遭男設計師突襲吻頸。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣欣遭男設計師突襲吻頸。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191809791798939648378609.jpeg/PhkCcn8noHEf8YLrQc47aqPM2G1DH4_E2iWExtolhMY\"/><figcaption>蔣欣遭男設計師突襲吻頸。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣欣遭男設計師突襲吻頸，受到驚嚇。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191809793938165760897326.jpeg/TgTl0tyi7S1KX94SQCQsmvUizoSmdHwPlho-gpYaPoI\"/><figcaption>蔣欣遭男設計師突襲吻頸，受到驚嚇。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"該男設計師與其他藝人合影時，皆保持著合宜的禮貌距離。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191809796018671616285034.jpeg/KrLVQOqJdBlz14SoA-LDbfXsKoPhejPNxqVOQsalTkI\"/><figcaption>該男設計師與其他藝人合影時，皆保持著合宜的禮貌距離。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"該男設計師與其他藝人合影時，皆保持著合宜的禮貌距離。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191809798359224320379425.jpeg/_FK7-U0Y2O-Jf52k4HS1RIeAYwUBWujSyjvfdMo733Q\"/><figcaption>該男設計師與其他藝人合影時，皆保持著合宜的禮貌距離。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"該男設計師與胡杏兒、惠英紅、周濤、蔣欣等人的合影。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191809787386400768189530.jpeg/Qb-1iY2eBxcUvLw4lMgGH51oNHCOQR01ocI80qHCPNI\"/><figcaption>該男設計師與胡杏兒、惠英紅、周濤、蔣欣等人的合影。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"當年飾演「華妃」的蔣欣憑一句「賤人就是矯情」而爆紅。（《後宮甄嬛傳》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2374721/org/ee01cb9fc557037dacb12d0866d4884b.jpg/SOTEApIIjuI_EPZw2AOfDEJXLAi5Ya3R7ITUoeyE1KE\"/><figcaption>當年飾演「華妃」的蔣欣憑一句「賤人就是矯情」而爆紅。（《後宮甄嬛傳》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣欣在《後宮甄嬛傳》飾演華妃娘娘。（《後宮甄嬛傳》劇照截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2374685/org/aa46b0683bc7262e83d74e600632579a.JPG/5B4b3u0onCq-NCSgCz0y82qFJE7MLy1e_78lkP-_JZA\"/><figcaption>蔣欣在《後宮甄嬛傳》飾演華妃娘娘。（《後宮甄嬛傳》劇照截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣欣（微博@蔣欣）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221006/654686939697778688267948.jpeg/6HvTjl0RTFW2IUiSE4oQ6U7M8kjal4BkRII6skSCOrI\"/><figcaption>蔣欣（微博@蔣欣）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣欣（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2009307/org/cbd9e216188e1a73d45712dc3e9d5f4f.jpg/sweScotFAnGz-a12RmxSkLJoh-v8y_TUtSVa87UlWvM\"/><figcaption>蔣欣（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>只見蔣欣在第一時間本能地伸手試圖推開對方、臉上表情短暫僵住且滿是受驚，但驚魂未定之餘，仍迅速展現專業素養維持職業微笑，強忍尷尬配合完成拍照。</p><p>畫面流出後立刻引爆網路上鋪天蓋地的罵聲，更有細心網友發現，該名設計師在同場大秀與胡杏兒、惠英紅、周濤等其他大牌女星同框合照時，皆保持著合宜的禮貌距離，唯獨對蔣欣做出如此突襲式的親密舉動，差別待遇相當令人傻眼。</p><p>眾人紛紛留言砲轟：</p><p>「這是性騷擾吧」</p><p>「完全超出正常社交邊界」</p><p>「太不尊重人了」</p><p>而截至目前為止，設計師馬凱、品牌方以及蔣欣團隊皆尚未對此事作出回應。</p><figure><img alt=\"延伸閱讀：女星紺野Buruma節目遭男諧星當眾「伸手揉捏臀部」　好友痛斥離譜（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810198521745408528641.jpeg/68-L8O3kRebMz4OV4DVWsNV4zCmQtNoRSVUJQklVCUI\"/><figcaption>延伸閱讀：女星紺野Buruma節目遭男諧星當眾「伸手揉捏臀部」　好友痛斥離譜（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"節目中女星紺野Buruma（紺野ぶるま）在攀爬障礙物時，男諧星Tacos竟出手揉捏對方臀部，畫面曝光後社群全炸鍋。（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810203064438784178293.jpeg/ytw9FATd6HTgArZPlL27fnBXsmY6fo3yxh1o6MYdaOg\"/><figcaption>節目中女星紺野Buruma（紺野ぶるま）在攀爬障礙物時，男諧星Tacos竟出手揉捏對方臀部，畫面曝光後社群全炸鍋。（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Tacos觸摸紺野Buruma的畫面全被攝影機拍下來。（YouTube影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188808218239832064370291.png/xzkqLthDgO74SlevlrZSHQ-fWHUDAofT_SEYPf0hGD0\"/><figcaption>Tacos觸摸紺野Buruma的畫面全被攝影機拍下來。（YouTube影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"揩油者「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810890883895296291874.jpeg/mcukUBtCgwyfMwwiVCUfWWhAVloz9wJM87KiOfOyojk\"/><figcaption>揩油者「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810200933601280801439.jpeg/P7OlVl2MJLYJAJuxvUOhvMbToPbreqxWUilk6lIpZOo\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810205161721856962385.jpeg/5yErw9-yMfOWntbZkv_hxRN-9xCtTj3Y20gM9ttIDPY\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810207305142272529308.jpeg/oP8mPweGokguX0E_a-2FDsyS3tPi2VJAjumyZ47psmc\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810199801008128136024.jpeg/HbjCcb9iyOgMDc0Q4JkCHk2eeEIJxGriSb2B2Em9gdg\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810201927651328047365.jpeg/Wk_cXGQDFnH7p9_ISyRT516grBNC6jfXv59pmr-faZo\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810203978797056129740.jpeg/K6Gft49GkI8-fXjeNIWSrBF3q9XVZKa42rApxNqwKcQ\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810206088663040652381.jpeg/wbIoSlNlVVwpsYkabqj4wctO2oRMM0AWL2Y4zC9mOMw\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810208198529024382570.jpeg/BGfAmoDU3N0lsUGDbHIJh1G8oN8DAu-e3jShsd40obE\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188811482771492864574831.jpeg/dbXv9Alxrf0KCOwQs96O1yod7tMe3LpxQSJ2_EEidvw\"/><figcaption>「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188811491970125824267549.jpeg/tz_T0vj0C608SyDSkAlb41R_HhJkF4bYnJSS75yUku8\"/><figcaption>「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188811484470317056301798.jpeg/modQuL2uq7uanQH661AJrjCeQwnLLNUZwpUEE8KVBBM\"/><figcaption>「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）</figcaption></figure><p>柯佳嬿《綁架遊戲》天天餵食坂口健太郎　李準基沒吃到一句追問笑翻</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T12:01:16.690877+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1502,"images":26,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T11:45:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T12:58:40.469843+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T11:58:40.375001+00:00","content_hash":"200203abee9bf19a2f3005712cb2ac241063e403ac93d6bfdf4cf4470206b499","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}